Cell["\<\
Hessian Matrix at the first stationary point is neither positively nor \
negatively definite, hence it is a point of inflection. 
Hessian Matrix at the second stationary point is positively definite, hence \
it is a point of  minimum.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8781622222550516`*^9, 3.8781622663543143`*^9}, {
  3.878162372303601*^9, 3.8781624007407246`*^9}, {3.8781624442360926`*^9, 
